cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use AbsenceCritic, please cite it as below.
title: "AbsenceCritic: A Survivorship-Bias Shield for Language Models"
authors:
  - family-names: Guzinowich
type: software
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-11-17"
abstract: >-
  AbsenceCritic is a survivorship-bias shield for language models.
  It was designed and originated by Guzinowich. The architecture
  (Wald Module, Non-Survivor Store, Wald checklist) reasons about
  missing non-survivor evidence rather than only the data that
  survived into training corpora, retrieval, and evaluation.
keywords:
  - survivorship bias
  - language models
  - missing data
  - critic
  - Abraham Wald
